{
  "id": "equal_areas___circles_vs__squares",
  "title": "Equal Areas - Circles vs. Squares",
  "description": "Calculate radius and side lengths of equal areas for circles and squares. Solve for the radius of a circle or side of a square when they have equal areas.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Equal Areas - Circles vs. Squares\n\nCalculate the radius and side lengths of circles and squares with equal areas.\n\n## Formulas\n\n**Circle Area:** Ac = π r²\n\n**Square Area:** As = s²\n\n**When Ac = As:** π r² = s²\n\n**Radius of Circle (given square side):** r = √(s² / π)\n\n**Side of Square (given circle radius):** s = √(π r²)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Circle Radius to Square Side"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "circle_radius",
          "label": "Circle Radius",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 2,
          "unit": "m"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "square_side_from_radius",
          "label": "Square Side Length",
          "formula": "Math.sqrt(Math.PI * inputs.circle_radius * inputs.circle_radius)",
          "unit": "m",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "circle_area",
          "label": "Area",
          "formula": "Math.PI * inputs.circle_radius * inputs.circle_radius",
          "unit": "m²",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Square Side to Circle Radius"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "square_side",
          "label": "Square Side Length",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 3.54,
          "unit": "m"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "circle_radius_from_side",
          "label": "Circle Radius",
          "formula": "Math.sqrt(inputs.square_side * inputs.square_side / Math.PI)",
          "unit": "m",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "square_area",
          "label": "Area",
          "formula": "inputs.square_side * inputs.square_side",
          "unit": "m²",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}